==About==
{{#section:Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2026|Intro}}<br><br>
The '''RLCS 2026 Paris Major''' {{IsTournamentFinished|took|will take|is taking}} place in Nanterre, France at [https://www.parisladefense-arena.com/ Paris La Défense Arena].

===Format===
*'''Group Stage''' - ''May 20th - 21st''
**16 teams - split into 4 groups of 4.
**Single Round Robin.
***All matches are {{Bo|5}}.
****<span class="bg-up">Winner</span> of each group qualifies to the Upper Bracket of the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
****<span class="bg-stay">Place 2 and 3</span> of each group qualify to the Lower Bracket of the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
****<span class="bg-down">4th</span> of each group are eliminated.
***<span class="mw-customtoggle-Side-Selection" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''See the group stage tiebreakers:''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Side-Selection" style="margin-top:10px;">
*Match Record against tied Teams
*Game Differential against tied Teams
*Overall Game Differential
*Goal Differential against tied Teams
*Overall Goal Differential
*Initial Seed
</div>
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''May 22nd - 24th''
**12-Teams Hybrid Elimination Bracket.
**Top 4 of the [[#Group Stage|Group Stage]] start with two chances before the Final Four, whereas teams ranked 5th-12th start with one chance.
***All matches are {{Bo|7}}.
<br>
''Crowd Days: May 22nd - 24th''

